---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components

  * nano/doom/ is a platform layer written for this project, but it is built
    against id Software's linuxdoom-1.10 sources, which are GPL-2.0.  The
    resulting NDOOM.N32 binary is therefore GPL-2.0.  Those sources are
    downloaded at build time and are not included here.

  * tools/mkfont.py rasterises a TrueType font into build/guifont.h.  The
    default face is Barlow (SIL Open Font License 1.1).  No font data is
    committed to this repository; the header is generated locally.

  * minimp3 (used by the music player) is public domain (CC0) and is
    downloaded at build time.

  * tools/nasm/ contains NASM, which is BSD-2-Clause licensed.
